LavenderTown_Interior1_Text_WorkerF::
	.string "There’s a RADIO-VISIO channel\n"
	.string "that plays POKéFLUTE music.\p"
	.string "Oh? Ah, the RADIO-VISIO needs an\n"
	.string "EXPN CARD to tune into it.$"

LavenderTown_Interior1_Text_Gentleman::
	.string "To the north of LAVENDER is ROCK\n"
	.string "TUNNEL. Go through it to get to\l"
	.string "the POWER PLANT.$"

LavenderTown_Interior1_Text_Youngster_1::
	.string "The RADIO STATION can’t broadcast\n"
	.string "because the POWER PLANT is down.$"

LavenderTown_Interior1_Text_Youngster_2::
	.string "The DIRECTOR of the RADIO STATION\n"
	.string "sure was happy.\p"
	.string "He said they’re back on the air\n"
	.string "because the POWER PLANT is running\l"
	.string "smoothly again.$"
